{"t":"Zaoan Helmet","s":"zaoan-helmet-36c54","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Zaoan_Helmet_33a8f2.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Zaoan Helmet</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Zaoan Helmet\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Zaoan_Helmet_33a8f2.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">knights and paladins</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Combat Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"imbueslots\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Imbuing Slots</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"upgradeclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Upgrade Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"armor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Armor</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"resist\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Resists</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">physical +5%</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Body Equipment<br/>Helmets</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">66.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">45,000 - 60,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">45,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.54<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 9, 2009<br/>Christmas Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20091202011847&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Zaoan_Helmet_33a8f2.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a Zaoan helmet <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Arm:9, protection physical +5%)</span>.<br/>Imbuements: (Empty Slot).<br/>Classification: 2 Tier: 0.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by knights and paladins.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 66.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Part of the Zaoan Set. It is better than the <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Helmet\">Demon Helmet</a>, since the <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Helmet\">Demon Helmet</a> has one armor value more, which blocks 0.7 damage on average, while the Zaoan Helmet has 5% protection against <a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\">Physical Damage</a>, which blocks at least 1 damage. <br/>\nIf a creature hits an average of 100 damage every hit, Demon Helmet will reduce the damage with a minimum of 4.8 and a maximum of 8.5 while Zaoan Helmet will reduce it with a minimum of 4.3 and maximum of 7.6 with an additional of 5%.<br/>\nIn the end, Zaoan Helmet will reduce the damage by 9min and 12max compared to Demon helmet with 5 min and 9 max.<br/>\nDwarven Helmet only reduces the damage by 2.9 min and 5.7 max with an additional amount of 2% which goes towards reducing 4.8 min and 7.6 max. Keep in mind that \"100 damage\" was used for the calculation. The price of the Zaoan Helmet has decreased since the <a href=\"#/wiki/Elite%20Draken%20Helmet\">Elite Draken Helmet</a> was implemented because it was first used by many Paladins.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Striker\">Darklight Striker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Draken%20Abomination\">Draken Abomination</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Draken%20Elite\">Draken Elite</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ethershreck\">Ethershreck</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghastly%20Dragon\">Ghastly Dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hatebreeder\">Hatebreeder</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Chosen\">Lizard Chosen</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Gate%20Guardian\">Lizard Gate Guardian</a></li>\n<li><